<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natbank sets unchanged 3 pct repo.</title>
<headline>Austria Natbank sets unchanged 3 pct repo.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it was calling for bids on one-week securities repurchase agreements at an unchanged and fixed 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>Bids must be in by 1300 GMT.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 12.19 billion schillings in repos.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-254</p>
